        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In order to treat—and potentially cure—a broader range of severe diseases, we and our collaboration partners are advancing the development of additional clinical and preclinical product candidates.",
